{'symbol': 'CNC', 'date': '2021-08-17 08:47:00', 'title': 'CENTENE SUBSIDIARY BUCKEYE HEALTH PLAN AWARDED OHIO MEDICAID CONTRACT', 'text': 'ST. LOUIS, AUG. 17, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CENTENE CORPORATION (NYSE:\xa0CNC) ANNOUNCED TODAY ITS OHIO SUBSIDIARY, BUCKEYE HEALTH PLAN, HAS BEEN AWARDED A MEDICAID CONTRACT BY THE OHIO DEPARTMENT OF MEDICAID TO CONTINUE SERVING MEMBERS WITH QUALITY HEALTHCARE, COORDINATED SERVICES, AND BENEFITS. THE CONTRACT WILL COMMENCE IN EARLY 2022.'}